bility pauses new observational strokes; loss of reach, unsafe conditions or surface destruction interrupts work. Resume only after revalidation and append to existing strokes. Cancellation leaves the partial sketch and disturbed ground; no energy, time or deposited material is refunded. Untouched reserved material is released. Death cancels ongoing execution under ordinary inventory handling and leaves the real surface marks; no duplicate artifact is awarded. Concurrent drawing must revision-check the surface and cannot overwrite others' work without an actual surface-changing action. No autonomous drawing continues after interruption. The sketch persists subject to actual trampling, weather and surface changes; maintenance is optional paid retracing or redrawing, not permanent preservation or a background fee. Completion means the selected strokes were physically executed, not that the subject was depicted well. Development/review waiting advances no simulation time. Surface eligibility, costs, stroke limits, persistence and failure checks run in code.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":2,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"Sol individually studies for two active rounds only after implementation; learning is not mastery and gives no automatic wellbeing. A retained drawing is the functional effect. Personally applicable observation, an informative failed suitability test or actual modest enjoyment of drawing can supply distinct evidence, not guaranteed pleasure. Use the same optional limits as the food review: at most 0.1 short pleasure per qualifying real event, 0.2 per actor per ten rounds, expiry after ten rounds, and functional deduplication across probe, mark and drawing for the same event. Recurring legitimate practice may sustain at most 0.04 satisfaction per eligible round up to 0.2, decaying 0.002 per inactive round; novelty is not required, but applicability and real participation are. No invented audience response or consent: another participant must independently observe or communicate through an actual action before any social event exists. No physical comfort or nutrition is supplied. Protected reward accounts, budgets, goals and permissions remain untouched; without an authorized experience mechanism, emit evidence only.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"The drawing must be an inspectable world-surface artifact, not a success message. Store reusable surface-local polyline geometry, bounds, depth or deposited material, contrast derived from the actual surface, actor, subject reference, creation/update times, completed strokes, partial/completed/eroded status and surface revision. Emit suitability-test, stroke-added, paused, failed and completed events only after corresponding physical work. Render the actual test groove and partial strokes on interruption; render completion only after committed strokes. Subject labels must not substitute for geometry, and no attractive artwork, mastery animation or satisfied facial expression is presumed. Subsequent inspection can report visible marks without asserting artistic merit or recognition.\\\"}]}\"}","logprobs":[]}

